tation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1015505","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1055","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[43,25,65,68,53,56],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1015505","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1055","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[43,25,65,68,53,56],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1015505","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1055","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[43,25,65,68,53,56],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1015505","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东汉会稽太守，弘农王刘辩妃唐姬（唐念）之父。颍川人，灵帝至献帝时期，官至会稽太守。其任职期间，恰逢汉末乱世，灵帝驾崩后刘辩被废杀，唐姬归乡守寡，唐瑁曾欲令其改嫁，遭女儿以死相拒。后李傕破长安，抄掠关东时掳获唐姬，欲强娶之，唐姬坚贞不从，终保名节。","tc":"東漢會稽太守，弘農王劉辯妃唐姬（唐念）之父。潁川人，靈帝至獻帝時期，官至會稽太守。其任職期間，恰逢漢末亂世，靈帝駕崩后劉辯被廢殺，唐姬歸鄉守寡，唐瑁曾欲令其改嫁，遭女兒以死相拒。后李傕破長安，抄掠關東時擄獲唐姬，欲強娶之，唐姬堅貞不從，終保名節。","en":"Governor of Huiji during the Eastern Han dynasty, and the father of Consort Tang (Tang Nian), consort to Liu Bian, the Prince of Hongnong. A native of Yingchuan, he rose to the position of Governor of Huiji across the reigns of Emperor Ling and Emperor Xian. His tenure coincided with the turmoil of the late Han. Following Emperor Ling's passing, Liu Bian was deposed and murdered, prompting Consort Tang to return home to live as a widow. Tang Mao attempted to have her remarry, but his daughter adamantly refused upon pain of death. Later, when Li Jue breached Changan and plundered Guandong, he captured Consort Tang and sought to take her by force, but she remained resolute and unyielding, preserving her honor to the end.","jp":"後漢の会稽太守であり、弘農王・劉弁の妃である唐姫（唐念）の父。潁川の人。霊帝から献帝の時代にかけて、官位は会稽太守に至った。在任期間はちょうど漢末の乱世にあたり、霊帝の崩御後に劉弁が廃位・殺害されると、唐姫は郷里に戻って操を守った。唐瑁は娘を再婚させようとしたが、娘は死をもってこれを拒絶した。後に李傕が長安を破り、関東を略奪した際に唐姫を捕らえて妻にしようとしたが、唐姫は固く拒んで従わず、最後まで名節を守り抜いた。","kr":"동한의 회계태수이자 홍농왕 유변의 비 당희(당념)의 아버지입니다. 영천 출신으로 영제부터 헌제 시기에 이르기까지 관직이 회계태수에 이르렀습니다. 재임 기간 마침 한나라 말기의 난세를 맞이하였는데, 영제가 붕어한 후 유변이 폐위되어 살해당하자 당희는 고향으로 돌아와 수절하였습니다. 당모가 딸을 개가시키려 하였으나 딸이 죽음으로 완강히 거부하였습니다. 이후 이각이 장안을 함락하고 관동을 약탈할 때 당희를 사로잡아 강제로 혼인하려 하였으나, 당희가 절개를 지키며 끝까지 따르지 않아 끝내 명절을 지켰습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1041515","remark":"","surname":"唐","surnameTc":"唐","surnameEn":"Tang","surnameJp":"唐","surnameKr":"당","surnameOther":"","name":"瑁","nameTc":"瑁","nameEn":"Mao","nameJp":"瑁","nameKr":"모","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"唐瑁","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"0","city":"CS1055","gender":"0","rule":"43","force":"25","wise":"65","politics":"68","charm":"53","will":"56","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"4","willTalent":"4","weaponMaster":"21/32/23/12/23/12/22/23","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"2500","battleSoulPoint":"2500","debateSoulPoint":"2500","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/0/2/2/0/1/0/0/1/0/0/1/2/0/0/0/0/0/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"0","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","bir